message: "Please cite the manuscript of the same title by Hu and Mosalam and identify the repository commit used."
title: "Task-aligned model selection and measurement validity for segmentation-derived crop canopy fraction"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/STAIRlab/task-aligned-segmentation-evaluation"
authors:
  - family-names: "Hu"
    given-names: "Fan"
  - family-names: "Mosalam"
