abstract: >-
  Processed records and stored-result reproduction scripts for seven-model
  Stage-1, Stage-2 and CropAndWeed comparisons, with M3-specific representation,
  estimator and estimand checks as a secondary component. No training or
  inference reproduction is claimed.
